,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<h2> How does voting work?</h2>',
'',
'<h3>Vote for the next courses!</h3>',
'<ul>',
unistr('<li>\D83D\DCC5 Voting opens a week before the next tournament</li>'),
unistr('<li>\D83C\DFCC\FE0F Cast your vote (vote for one, all, or none)</li>'),
unistr('<li>\D83C\DD95 Upvote/downvote courses</li>'),
unistr('<li>\D83C\DFB2 Ties broken by a die roll</li>'),
'</ul>',
'<br>',
'<div class="t-Report-cell">',
unistr('\26F3 Make your voice count each week!<br>'),
'',
'<br>',
unistr('\D83D\DC49 run <code>/votes</code> in the #wmgt-chat channel to keep tabs the current results!<br>'),
'<br>',
'</div>',
'<br>',
'You must be in good standing and have participated in the WMGT to vote. The next courses will usually be decided 5 days before the next tournament. <br>',
